    "description": "<p>The Hungry Ghost stylist is nourished by the agony of his enemies, sustaining his fighting spirit with their suffering. The martial artist can use Power-Reaping Prana whenever he deals lethal or aggravated damage to an Essence user with an unarmed attack. He must have already used Blood-Scenting Hunger to assess that target's Essence pool earlier in the scene. Doing so allows him to regain a single point of Willpower or a channel of Valor. He cannot use it more than once per action.</p>",
